    "header_color": "red",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "The bare command is the root alone:",
          "",
          "   Simama!    Stand!",
          "   Njoo!      Come! (irregular)",
          "   Nenda!     Go!  (irregular)",
          "",
          "To a group, add -eni:",
          "",
          "   Simameni!  All of you, stand!",
          "",
          "The negative command: u-si- / m-si-,",
          "final vowel to -e:",
          "",
          "   Usiibe!    Don't steal!",
          "   Msiibe!    Don't steal (you all)!",
          "",
          "Hear them:                         Press 1"
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Simama! Simameni! Usiibe!"
        }
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "Soften a command into a wish and you",
          "have the SUBJUNCTIVE: final -a -> -e,",
          "no WHEN bead at all.",
          "",
          "   Twende!         Let's go!",
          "   Uende sasa.     You should go now.",
          "   Polisi waje.    The police should",
          "                   come.",
          "",
          "Hear them:                         Press 1",
          "",
          "This -e mood carries requests,",
          "suggestions, purposes — Lesson 19's",
          "ili loves it: Ninafanya kazi ili",
          "watoto wale.  ...so the children eat."
        ],
        "pronunciation_mappings": {
          "1": "Twende! Uende sasa. Polisi waje."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
